      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Named after John F. Ely, a pioneer railroad builder and Burlington, Cedar Rapids and Northern Railway officer, the town reflects early rail history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
